flowchart TB
  accTitle: Decoder with a tied token embedding and output head
  accDescr: Token IDs use embedding E of shape V by C. Add learned positions before the block stack, then apply final LayerNorm and project to vocabulary logits using the same E. Tying counts E once.
  E["Shared E · [V, C]"] --> L["Token lookup + learned positions"]
  I["Token IDs · [B, T]"] --> L
  L --> H["Block stack → final LayerNorm"]
  H --> O["Logits = hidden × Eᵀ · [B, T, V]"]
  E -->|"same parameter"| O
